---
title: DR Lifecycle - Active/Passive State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Bootstrap
    Bootstrap --> Steady: 00_setup in BOTH / dr_state=east
    Steady --> Steady: CDC EAST to WEST (delta, ~15m)
    Steady --> Failover: EAST down OR drill
    Failover --> PromotedWest: flip dr_state=west (verified)
    PromotedWest --> PromotedWest: users author models on WEST
    PromotedWest --> ReverseCDC: EAST recovers
    ReverseCDC --> ReverseCDC: CDC WEST to EAST (catch up)
    ReverseCDC --> Failback: WEST quiesced AND EAST caught up
    Failback --> Steady: reset dr_state=east (verified)

    note right of Steady
        EAST = active primary
        WEST = warm passive mirror
    end note
    note right of PromotedWest
        WEST = active primary
        EAST = down / recovering
    end note
